            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: A creature within 30 feet of Raskus uses a move action, makes a ranged attack, or leaves a square during a move action it's using\n\nRequirements: Raskus holds a loaded spike launcher\n\nRaskus attempts a spike launcher Strike against the triggering creature. This Strike doesn't contribute to his multiple attack penalty, and his multiple attack penalty doesn't apply to this Strike."
